 "page_text": "Title: Dr. Paul Klopsteg- Archery Hall of Fame and Museum\n\nURL Source: http://archeryhalloffame.com/Klopsteg.html\n\nMarkdown Content:\n![Image 1: Archery Hall of Fame and Museum](http://archeryhalloffame.com/images/header.jpg) [**Ho**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/ \"Home Page\")**[me](http://archeryhalloffame.com/)****----------- [Grass Root](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Grass%20Roots%20Supporters.html) [Supporters](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Grass%20Roots%20Supporters.html)**[**Inductees**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/inductee.html \"Inductees\") **------------** [**Past Photos**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Photos%20from%20the%20Past.html) **------------******[**Current**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Present%20Day%20Photos.html)[**Photos**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Present%20Day%20Photos.html)**[Museum](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Museum.html)********----------********[We Get Letter](http://archeryhalloffame.com/We%20get%20Letters.html)s****[Inductions](http://archeryhalloffame.com/2006%20Induction.html \"Photos of Past Inductions\")********----------********[Newsletters](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Newsletter%20Master.html)****[Criteria](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Criteria.html)********--------****[The History](http://archeryhalloffame.com/History.html)****[Special Awards](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Karl%20Palmatier%20Award.html)****------------****[Mission Statement](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Our%20Mission.html)****--------------**[**Remember the PA**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/PAA-1.html)**A****[News](http://archeryhalloffame.com/News.html \"What's Happening\")****---------- [Features](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Specail%20Feature.html)****Loyal****[Supporters](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Supporters.html \"Supporters\")********-----------********[Memorial](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Donations.html)**s**----------**[**BHOF**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/inductee-page2.html)**[Contact Us](http://archeryhalloffame.com/About%20us.html)********----------******[**Director**](http://archeryhalloffame.com/Board%20of%20Directors.html)**s**\n\n_****_ _**# Dr. Paul Klopsteg **Class of 1976** **\\_Influence on the Sport\\_** # Notes of Interest * Archery scientist, author * Co-authored Archery: The Technical Side with Dr. C. N. Hickman and Forrest Nagler * Physicist and Research Engineer; Chief of Research/Development Section in General MacArthur's command in the Pacific Theatre of Operations during World War II * Developed methods and devices for covert use by secret agents behind enemy lines; later, Professor of Applied Science, Northwestern University * All recurve composite bows made today make use of his scientific findings * Chairman, Board of Governors, National Archery Association, 1935-39 * Recipient, National Archery Association's Thompson Medal of Honor, 1939 * Recipient, National Field Archery Association Compton Medal of Honor, 1947 \\_**![Image 2](http://archeryhalloffame.com/images/Klopsteg/Klopsteg2.jpg) Fred Bear and Dr. Klopsteg at the 1976 Induction ![Image 3](http://archeryhalloffame.com/images/Klopsteg/hof.jpg)**\\_**_![Image 4](http://archeryhalloffame.com/images/Klopsteg/Klopsteg-1%20-%20Ye%20Sylvan%20Bk%20Pg%205%20.jpg) ![Image 5](http://archeryhalloffame.com/images/Klopsteg/klopsteg3.jpg) ![Image 6](http://archeryhalloffame.com/images/Klopsteg/sleeping.jpg)\n\nCopyright: 2017 Archery Hall of Fame & Museum, Inc. Unauthorized use of images and content is strictly prohibited. - All Rights Reserved -Office: P.O. Box 558 North Main Street Union City, PA 16438 USA Phone: 1.814.392.8901 Email:[info@archeryhalloffame.org](mailto:info@archeryhalloffame.org)\n"
}

